0000-glm-exl3-route: TensorFold 0.6.2 port series (apply after the lower numbers, patch -p0 in the directory
that holds the installed tensorfold package).
Origin: new in this port (Apache-2.0).
Port: new for 0.6.1, on 0.6.2: keeps GLM's own EXL3 expert kernels beside the universal route (TF_GLM_EXL3_PATH); its codebook beside 0.6.2's bits_of (a mixed-bit checkpoint refused by name).
